<attrib name="id" value="sec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>4</no><heading guid="_a5fb010c-8ff8-479f-8dc0-49a25ea50446"
id="sec.4-he"><b>Appropriation for services of
Legislature</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act appropriates the sum of $231,945,373 to
the Legislature out of the Consolidated Fund for the services of the
Legislature for the year 2023&#8211;24.</txt></block>
<note type="legtext" guid="_5ba96dbc-a917-4572-8106-9370695f745c"
id="sec.4-note"><heading guid="_04fb0fef-e11d-4312-8a3e-308d16b0c27d"
id="sec.4-note-he"><b>Note&#8212;</b></heading>
<block><txt break.before="1">The appropriation, together with funds from other
sources, is intended to fund&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_bd821fa8-1b4b-447c-b519-f0fa9c14825a" id="sec.4-note-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">expenses to the sum of $234,158,940,
and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_13fb9e6c-655a-42b4-b0d6-a41199af9320" id="sec.4-note-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">capital expenditure to the sum of
$43,864,000.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></note>
</level>
</level>


<level type="part" id="pt.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_308fb486-fa5d-4ddc-8004-3cf8782e66a3"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="pt.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no><b>Part 3</b></no><heading guid="_5b19ec9e-a10e-410d-9547-65ad1ff0d159"
id="pt.3-he"><b>General</b></heading></head>

<level type="clause" id="sec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_5e97e38a-ec04-4f4c-b6b9-20fe5bc17cb1"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>5</no><heading guid="_2e31f232-cfc1-4fd6-a2aa-2b3ce6fbf242"
id="sec.5-he"><b>Payments authorised on lapse of
appropriation</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">An amount is taken to have been expended out of a
sum appropriated for a purpose by this Act if the amount&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_c98debf2-63cf-406d-b7d8-ff056785581d" id="sec.5-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">was paid for the purpose out of the Consolidated
Fund under the <legref refid="act-2018-055" jurisd="NSW" type="act"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Government Sector Finance Act
2018</i></name></legref>, section 4.10, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_459f1eec-eab3-4b06-ac47-4ef5ac6b8908" id="sec.5-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">was paid on or after 1 July 2023 and before the
date of assent to this Act.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></level>
</level>
</content>


